name: Review last-row and group controls retain distinct keyboard ownership
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_navigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 Owned first observation | first-row
nav-mode:
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 F-0003 | last-row
expect: Owned last observation
expect: End last
expect: G groups
keys: G
require-live-snap: 25 3 groups / 3 findings | groups
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Owned last observation | returned-row
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 Owned last observation | review-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 Owned last observation | review-96x89
expect: End last
expect: G groups
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 Owned last observation | review-80x24
expect: End last
expect: G groups
expect: Ctrl+F filter
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 Owned last observation | review-60x20
expect: End last
expect: G groups
expect: Ctrl+F filter
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 F-0003 | review-40x12
expect: End last
expect: G groups
expect: Ctrl+F filter
expect: Enter detail
ask: Can the operator distinguish End for the final row from G for groups, with selection preserved after returning and resizing?
submit: findings filter limit:2
nav-mode:
require-live-snap: 20 Ctrl+N | tiny-paged-first
keys: C-n
require-live-snap: 20 Owned last observation | tiny-paged-last
expect: Ctrl+P
keys: C-p
require-live-snap: 20 Owned first observation | tiny-paged-return
expect: Ctrl+N
submit: findings filter clear
nav-mode:
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Owned last observation | tiny-unpaged-return
expect: End last
expect: G groups
resize: 120x36
submit: modules
submit: run threat-model:build {"pipeline":"deterministic","offline":true,"variantScan":false}
require-live-snap: 25 reuse | cached-prerequisite
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 partial result | completed-context
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 reusing cached context snapshot | reused-context
expect: running tool: threat-model:build
expect-not: calling model
expect-not: asking model-backed tool
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_navigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does r reuse the cached prerequisite and leave an honest completion receipt without requesting a model?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: findings
nav-mode:
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Owned last observation | recovered-last-row
expect: End last
expect: G groups
expect-not: d Discard
keys: G
require-live-snap: 25 3 groups / 3 findings | recovered-groups
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_navigation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart retain all observations and expose the same independent group and row actions?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
